
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@contentType = application/json

###
# @name GetGroups
GET  {{baseUrl}}/groups
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Get All Joined Groups (Default)
GET {{baseUrl}}/groups?page=1&limit=10
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###

### Get Joined Groups
GET {{baseUrl}}/groups?type=joined&page=1&limit=10
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###

### Get Created Groups
GET {{baseUrl}}/groups?type=created&page=1&limit=10
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###

### Search Groups
GET {{baseUrl}}/groups?search=f&page=1&limit=10
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###

### Search Joined Groups
GET {{baseUrl}}/groups?type=joined&search=developers&page=1&limit=10
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###

### Search Created Groups
GET {{baseUrl}}/groups?type=created&search=developers&page=1&limit=10
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###

### Test Pagination (Page 2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/groups?type=joined&page=2&limit=5
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###

### Test Different Page Size
GET {{baseUrl}}/groups?type=created&page=1&limit=20
Content-Type: {{contentType}}


